# Gitignored files copied into each new worktree so a fresh checkout can boot the dev
# stack. Read by bin/start-worktree (and by Claude Code's own worktree support).
# bin/start-worktree then rewrites the copy's POSTGRES_URL to the worktree's own database.
# node_modules is NOT copied — bin/start-worktree runs `npm ci` instead.
.env.local
